  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d322f27ee80c52e8d7e09dea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f1b8c4b957bae67f592adc4bef70ac5f3627a464d0dc0ce6dfe10fabdc82049",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f48a48d08e13e4484f799f16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要夹得紧紧的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1278abfbc7c62df0a0784d2f826f5b8f9816e7b66a9357d4c2fc83346fa781dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7643b29cdefc0a752e5592f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "jia！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc18a78c997c6d87b55ca02069de8471610322620c255fb4bf9121eb924646fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d1bdf38bdcb36d425c2943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哇哇～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f68b455423be43bae38186d6e4cca0af8ae05ef64b9b4294d34c8b7ba907885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baa5da9f77b04089a735af23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么啦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a885118b79faf7143f52f30f2b512a0c031eae2290764023cf5c0e94ae074dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4341173d5b85b186e5325fea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "jiajia～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c601feaef663f6054da656960cc8ac45ef8ed20a82fa22aba4fef25876b6951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6210e785a0ab61000de7a971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a6cbc3dbb12c098c30355bb7c6e811e7efa371a964aa64771c972a5f15a308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9bfc7ca335bdac003e2897f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的话好像能拿到这个呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca87ea86bce7673ef72a7448b4f47e5d80dda086513b995424b49dce6138284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a6ca0fc52a46dfef1b4a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好累……累蒙圈了……\r\n抱歉，我可能已经到极限了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6451cc2fcdb37a1b22d649bbb89c1e41477e0bde57b6c7daafaa7708ffecc45f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f99f27bbcbb76a47583db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能稍微休息一下吗？\r\n休息的份我会努力补上的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df37833f43e64296cc7c4ce79a5f6c3573bd5ae5820fb995b7dd2c26562ebbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0dc33229f0e973ecd5f6cfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神满满！精力充沛～！！\r\n训练员，不管什么训练都放马过来吧！\r\n我会以雪国的毅力，好好完成的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5dfc12f2e3b7f244626a5dfa46f250ef6406ee1a98e14227e57e0e2b55520e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc32a07bf2b34810d8851d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论是火中水中还是雪中！\r\n如果是现在的话哪里都能\r\n跑下去哦～！！哼、哼！哼哼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6085284751d8cd21400d7868b045f9311089cd487aa3683b2423d11ac8f9b05b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d36ab79a7b2926c7758b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，今天也要以“城市女孩”为目标，\r\n好好地加油训练了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e2d8b6139fd9f7ebcaec14c5b2821d669b3083d0b18e6937535aec7ef29417e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb1ae4dda7c99a97a4e804e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盐分的补充已经靠老家寄来的腌菜完成了！\r\n吃起来咸咸辣辣的，\r\n只要吃了这个就会感觉很清爽呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeebf7437cd838f5d7744a8471ff9575454c3dbe6feac61ab56e5236c323b10c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ab2c1ab5076f89c183e7d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不输给雨，不输给风。\r\n但也不能勉强自己。靠这结实的\r\n身体，今天也一起努力加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a476b7e04b656ef1beb3cc653ecf86477651123a413e63919829b898afbaaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c5c48bbbcb6d91e38f2803",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想提升下心情啊～\r\n……啊！能一边听着些爽朗的歌\r\n一边跑步吗？就像广告一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07d2631db13970dabbee098c67621c7417a94ca01210f63dfa8fee3a8039e96f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9ad514fdc430538033fc62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈欠，诶呀……好困……不好意思……\r\n这样是……不行的吧……嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca722ce62529c2704f101aa82254346aa6018fe82ce89c102dc32829710a11f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2082530b9c97cf51dc7242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呆～……哈！集中注意集中注意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d16725bafa33e5fc656cae65068b4294e44560ce6c2f226b00dfe202f029841",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ece35563e447cc66f57a1df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗒～就像化掉的雪一样提不起劲啊。\r\n哈啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32b1083ef9a8c7ccafdcbc72e8dd9b7730a659fa0062ee1fcc5277d58d5dde9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c23586fc98c224b7fd9d7fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常抱歉……\r\n明明好不容易才来到这里的，\r\n我的状态却那么差……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc872741d4a0e8def5b3f2e2a8077085b1844a376ce0c1c2b93613669e43a958",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a991ce192f2973b723a96048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呀～最近参加的比赛有点太多了……\r\n不不，但是我会加油的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aeea34dbf3a49ca7f0dba0753408ab7cef7b2708bc0b00a5e3f30f2687b64e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c4160db3495066d1e424288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜咕咕，毅力、毅力……！\r\n脚就像是陷在雪里一样沉……\r\n还不够呢……！……啊噫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91aa8d056d9541e4d96e6b4b28d16329e14a9dd8047f2a15e89e39b6200dc950",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04b164aa13ca8b5fe5f575d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——已经做好万全准备了！\r\n今天感觉能跑出不错的成绩呢，\r\n训练员就好好看着吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddddb11344d389df3c7d5084836601e76e0effecc6aec0e396e5a5b7538ab815",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af8ba239645782156a4a7b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！头发也好好地梳好了\r\n……状态绝佳！\r\n那么就打起精神出发了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2b8eea5fd3320ed02b55722fa160d6f4ed08bbeb40393b78fff978c3e6d688",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd6aa39be2a42cd27e943002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛冈的大家不知道会不会在看着呢？\r\n如果是今天的状态的话\r\n应该能展现出自己帅气的一面吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c9a9fec2bae0e665966384b4fffe54ae8a8f0cf7b55b22990b86dac859954be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eef6614af36f88ea7910660f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃了老家的仙贝，现在感觉状态很不错呢！\r\n……我脸上应该没有沾上仙贝屑吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d6c766d10c02ad9edd4e4dbe441be042547abd251c479408bc27f017f405ac6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4120bf5f562f003cefb9fa6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚有粉丝向我搭话了呢……\r\n现在不仅状态不错，\r\n感觉还得到了更多的力量呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4bf7eb908d71889d2a81882b166e039fe66c35505e8ae1101540b7e68662692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77f1e1a545860d91260a19c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是紧张啊～！\r\n但是，比起来紧张更觉得是兴奋……\r\n现在这种状态的话感觉能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1818279cb1ec40db35e264c59b11e60934182539f9c40c538140b6555ac0aef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c44af24b6b38c102989f10a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然感觉普普通通……\r\n但反过来也说明没有变弱，\r\n在心情上说不定更轻松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d27e802887624cc957466b293ec3294a8df3498ef81b926137bcdd3a6b50d35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e3e1e598bea3e9008d82c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸——……呼——……\r\n……嗯，和往常一样呢！\r\n好好回想起训练时的内容，要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9056188bf3f8fea4b4c3b3ece38e2bda9cca7470e7e12e140bb8fbd1c48685dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a974aede20a9cbf7bec6ec2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态很一般，\r\n但之前所一直积累起的东西，\r\n就是在这种情况能派上用场呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cadae5600762b7f6523dd919275f9bcb9152008fc9758ac02489f425208adc94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c68a76bf182c11d25b93ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉身体有点发沉呢……\r\n咕啊～不不！\r\n这里正是展现雪国的毅力的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "983aa84a66b597de7a632b57c8bc216585be9f6c2f58e17066d31e9faf880e57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce33f22ddb28876d7e3e9e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使状态差强人意，就算面前是布满积雪的道路！\r\n该跑的时候就得跑起来，\r\n不做好这样的觉悟的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2543a9a3f3dbffebc8d8cd4c135c329ae5a353635b3d162570ce17a2779b87f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72bcd5563d44bc28ceb81746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有做好万全准备也没什么！\r\n如果这点事就泄气的话，\r\n可就当不了“城市女孩”……了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f8d12e6931643f70a9e670f743d72b3150f1717107cc56263343e7b4100ce27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82633d9b39779b9cb951f494",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态很差……我也不会放弃的。\r\n强大、美丽、又可爱……\r\n这可是我的目标啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "384e2927cd55b2e66078290abfac86d6abf2730eaea17bc3dfe956aac446976a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3592858bf8873bb3ca61b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态极差又怎样……\r\n为我应援的大家们失望的脸，\r\n才不想看到……所以……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9898185c4861a0065194ed187529dba85afb71b2245615b49f9d76fcd890a5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e35c2cd18326fb99b30303ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……脚……一点力气都使不上……\r\n至少现在得尽自己的最大努力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08f79f60b346240d284ecdb31e1ae9ba34a5910d8c1e202815763d07811bcf47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:061773de535621198feb762f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:120a36f38e1f86a25f9e5d5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哒啊啊啊啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c9415f252e01c59bc73f688d2acabe4f4f97167691cba17c9e588ccc148cc71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d60868800e8b918a3cd342d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee5201dc2d68a81891613ca1f4259ad3a3c07ce2bdee7721069ace6189f9acf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31395def7e782943e0fb1b20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要努力了呗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35df5b9ab7985f6021faa0f0d6d9d50f165fb165e05c1444a01d0336b4c69b63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6009e06f8ab4bda6cd896587",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真难啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c4b01cf3cb63ae6f8b8835a4a1b13c867fe5ab983aef95445948a9970f70ff5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92d78126791115653a020903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶呀呀～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5df482e2adb74269cf2ed874906d166ee89adc688a9dd964505ad43f6cfb59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1c15d4457f1ada2a8838be4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快来！快来～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5edcea134cc7e1647122bc4037bcc072f2332f3066612aab51b4316213104982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:517f32b74c1aea32591b9691",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到海边玩咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa5d9ce544f38c4537638901ac99dfd55c3bc2ddb6497654fbb57b7c5a28352d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc99a1b362b07ed7b9aa86f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要和故乡的大家分享至今为止发生的所有事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc5d07bd7d61119f4877ad654afbd6a66bacdf2a56fa8be568712692c235ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5f38886fcb6f553b9d6601",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常非常感谢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb99dfb6144d56f293e8f6532fd5c1c5732ca2220417dcb9041c66844008913",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db4a135c26e8471fda7a6662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb383dd8d2174be0f3f26e6d18a611208df1ed59db6554af6c4d69d27e3168b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8843b27e70c95930493940a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Fight、噢――的说～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e5ca511fdf897751c734aab69d8c4dccc930e6e7fab6e6ddae5b70ba63e8ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa1496ad312cc187108af27e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，一起上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "964aa8a5f85779fee82ac72fdc07e559295b2e293ca2b24f812e4fad0c408055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0032f6b91b7ce262e0471157",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的非常非常感谢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5090fe93af7a57283c441fdc26b578dab097cc4447163168ce29dd3222dfd8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b15a33bedb8108dc905599e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是紧张啊～！\r\n但是，比起来紧张更觉得是兴奋……\r\n现在这种状态的话感觉能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1818279cb1ec40db35e264c59b11e60934182539f9c40c538140b6555ac0aef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c85c2c9b9833ead5746608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛冈的大家不知道会不会在看着呢？\r\n如果是今天的状态的话\r\n应该能展现出自己帅气的一面吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c9a9fec2bae0e665966384b4fffe54ae8a8f0cf7b55b22990b86dac859954be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb97d48d2618196b91499fa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的非常非常感谢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5090fe93af7a57283c441fdc26b578dab097cc4447163168ce29dd3222dfd8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5491b740a496fc13a0ddf707",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くでがんす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3ad50f555d6b9ec8fbcb1a7c25f7c444b1200cef10343df24156484f3133466",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5adeeb75539fbc1b0744d6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哇哇～，太可惜了呗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfd69140dbea92223ee6d9aec225f3bc94c7d335e75a96f3b5f72e1fbd65a383",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0ed3ec9aa472c514ed25e3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就差一点了哇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7d9a44ba6e81b81f0204d148192b4585c8655060f6a69e27cfa958178bcf351",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:388717ee4e99b631766f1581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总算是入着了呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50461a629a04f139a778030a426e127ba7ac8267def2ca473068455ae67d20d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:040fac48991993bc4579a8f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，怎么会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c25a301a92b370b9b70c1dfb2690b53d9c46a6d833052a4940bdeac88c2394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a1fa18514a6ac9ee075971f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哇哇～……非常感谢大家的应援～！\r\n以后也请好好看着我吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb2c1227846128f5eb8b0984b1f95de11e306fc211c008e7021a40922dea72aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9795d946989b8e8b3be8406",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快来快来～！\r\n诶嘿，我赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f856fc9148db0ce2e9eef9d2a6b18a427e80d58c2c69a91c235eca548a0663d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b778146700458fbc1504e20b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎度ごひいきに、ありがとがんした！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa0368236b0ad4c553df2ea172aa31e6324bbd76927fef0b3a6230c6a25b1ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc11d2839237449080aa48c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あべあべ～！\r\nえへ、勝利だなはんっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6086ee1674b672b15765c624e702824b4fe83c667d6ece40df87b2d28a77baa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4a59ddcde5ed0237669dd61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拼尽全力地上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f0f4030fd7fd7b923ab9a2f4830ec96b2ef84a4c6cc76b141d25c3a9bde18d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4775eae94f111e187f7c67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪子我从这里开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dfa4502f4e8e7aad74a0de03b224c02022270e395ac37cb16c473e5fa74b8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95782ac0b01977875ac32aea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あわわわわ…な、なンかの、\r\nなンかの間違いじゃ\r\nねえのか…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b331c4293a997e223bc979044076a7f5d1965c6b2d76284e8ad4bdf4d11ac39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b6d631b9359a2438ff6e04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あたしが憧れたもの…\r\nあたしがなしてここまで走って\r\n来られたが…忘れちゃなンねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17c33b70453380c5faad31739ac4808eb383e650220912bec1e5370d5095e54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c4e37ce954802a82db88050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェさんがくれた柚子のチョコ…\r\n甘さ控えめで、柚子がすンげぇ\r\n香って…田舎さ思い出すなぁ～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef053726119cdc7ff69ede824a35e1235f4236c433c7fbb1749db6e80276c6d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7847fd56b1c243d77c7823",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洁白、而柔软……\r\n如此地耀眼，就像雪一样！\r\n我也一定能，让你着迷的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d1dc9d604d5dc938289c50809d7562688ce2db1c2ae9502dc98244efb5ddb09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c2ca7d416c6b6946233a19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地元のみんなも見てくれたンかぁ！\r\nへへ…けンど、踊ってた時の写真\r\n見るのはまだ、こっぱずかしいべ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a8ddd8203dd8add6573119de60749bf99be385dd8fa7070f752c147586ada4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c819806ff85dbf5c08eda5fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントミッションは\r\nこちらでがんす！えぇと～、\r\n何から始めればいいべ…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbbeb3a1ce8c8738c61b1f3b8d3bbf5ce508be970c8087553e19c2341ff3aa1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e11f326f6cd2459734c892f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受け取り忘れはねぇですか？\r\nンでは、また～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e864be8b5a5f33529ad771ca530776801f3280b8e2033e8239bb39ee99a02057",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3580f0aee2e630a9251c9ef9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントお疲れさンです！\r\nひゃっこい風が吹いてきてるなぁ…\r\nそろそろ冬が来ますねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64343bd7734b5d774ec004d272d57be10cf7c581451d04cb9cb477ffdd6c4ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:255d96147350646d69d5f891",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利の味、おあげんしぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9f8cd92e26fef38463fcb4311d10f55c810a8251718ed5ef895351d3b99d6f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66e70be95913f4979ba9c83b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一生懸命、真剣に…はっ！はっ！…たぁ～っ！\r\n…じゃじゃじゃっ！？…真心のチョコ、おあげんしぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1381d608762cef6e9a77843f741dfce1adea00415707be21c2dc4f798d4a099",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:151464435d6adcba4fe6490b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地元のお団子の和菓子が大好きで。\r\nごま蜜がとろ～っとあふれンです。\r\n手ェべたべたにしながら食べたなぁ",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a22c65a84e7e2c4217353463dc294abeb5158e125cce191a6c942be0c01bf10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd1721a41a2e8488cf2e832c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェさん、コーヒーはブラック\r\nだから、甘ぇお菓子がいいかなぁ…\r\nン～…あっ！どら焼きにクリーム！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0cb5ae52685e4503447526efcb6928544586bf7172261a44a9eeb65b06891b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "400071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d1dfb7d80f725268b23391",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好紧张啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65eb3fcd2b06f41b6f17d1acdf17ae1af913af7dd1d6acef0cc22e6086e9cc9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a58c7f12afaa8aca8fa9c2db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请好好看着吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "8113a9955aa8336399e9300cfe10eae72ad389bfed2f3a39a048b969f6ed3247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d450601f8fbd523649da2c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会以“城市女孩”为目标，奔跑下去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aa34eebd9970f205b7a978c9962605f261b8d35bc63a1e34cdf3d41d1fb3234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
